 4.16557L13.2188 0.722912C12.8954 0.270509 12.3699 0 11.8131 0H4.187C3.63018 0 3.10471 0.270509 2.78129 0.722912L0.31995 4.16557C-0.123503 4.78587 -0.104165 5.63671 0.36663 6.23436L8.00004 16L15.6328 6.2357C16.1042 5.63671 16.1236 4.78521 15.6801 4.16557ZM12.6766 1.11069C12.6766 1.11069 15.1867 4.62597 15.2073 4.66395H11.2389L9.86188 0.666278H11.8131C12.1552 0.666278 12.4779 0.832181 12.6766 1.11069ZM5.46668 4.66395L6.84372 0.666278H9.15635L10.5334 4.66395H5.46668ZM10.5521 5.33022L8.00004 13.7753L5.44801 5.33022H10.5521ZM3.32343 1.11069C3.52215 0.832181 3.84491 0.666278 4.187 0.666278H6.1382L4.76116 4.66395H0.793412C0.814085 4.62597 3.32343 1.11069 3.32343 1.11069ZM0.678048 5.33022H4.75115L7.42721 14.1851L0.891439 5.82327C0.776074 5.67735 0.705388 5.50679 0.678715 5.33022H0.678048ZM8.57219 14.1857L11.2483 5.33022H15.3214C15.2947 5.50679 15.2233 5.67802 15.108 5.8246L8.57219 14.1857Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div></div><div class="home-about_text-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">Corporate &amp; leisure</h3><div class="text-size-regular">Business travel managed end to end, and holidays planned down to the pick-up. We do both, well.</div></div></div><div class="home-about_list-item"><div class="home-about_icon-wrap"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5.00256 11.4188C5.0538 12.0493 5.56874 12.5 6.35781 12.5C7.14176 12.5 7.69769 12.0278 7.69769 11.3652V11.3598C7.69769 10.8179 7.3339 10.4745 6.79078 10.4235V10.4101C7.24167 10.3109 7.5696 9.98893 7.5696 9.50872V9.50335C7.5696 8.90778 7.08796 8.5 6.35269 8.5C5.63023 8.5 5.13834 8.92656 5.08198 9.5731L5.07942 9.59993H5.61742L5.61998 9.57579C5.65585 9.2163 5.94278 8.99095 6.35269 8.99095C6.77028 8.99095 7.0111 9.20825 7.0111 9.58115V9.58652C7.0111 9.94601 6.72417 10.2062 6.30145 10.2062H5.86849V10.673H6.31682C6.81127 10.673 7.11358 10.9172 7.11358 11.3545V11.3598C7.11358 11.7354 6.80871 11.9983 6.35781 11.9983C5.89923 11.9983 5.58924 11.7569 5.55337 11.4135L5.55081 11.384H5L5.00256 11.4188Z" fill="currentColor"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.17677 10.5013C8.17677 11.73 8.70453 12.5 9.58839 12.5C10.4697 12.5 11 11.73 11 10.5013V10.496C11 9.26727 10.4697 8.5 9.58839 8.5C8.70453 8.5 8.17677 9.26727 8.17677 10.496V10.5013ZM10.421 10.5013C10.421 11.4296 10.1136 11.9983 9.58839 11.9983C9.06063 11.9983 8.75576 11.4296 8.75576 10.5013V10.496C8.75576 9.56774 9.06063 9.00436 9.58839 9.00436C10.1136 9.00436 10.421 9.56774 10.421 10.496V10.5013Z" fill="currentColor"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.33333H13C14.654 1.33333 16 2.67933 16 4.33333V13C16 14.654 14.654 16 13 16H3C1.346 16 0 14.654 0 13V4.33333C0 2.67933 1.346 1.33333 3 1.33333H4V0.333333C4 0.149333 4.14933 0 4.33333 0C4.51733 0 4.66667 0.149333 4.66667 0.333333V1.33333H11.3333V0.333333C11.3333 0.149333 11.4827 0 11.6667 0C11.8507 0 12 0.149333 12 0.333333V1.33333ZM13 2H3C1.71333 2 0.666667 3.04667 0.666667 4.33333V5.33333H15.3333V4.33333C15.3333 3.04667 14.2867 2 13 2ZM3 15.3333H13C14.2867 15.3333 15.3333 14.2867 15.3333 13V6H0.666667V13C0.666667 14.2867 1.71333 15.3333 3 15.3333Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div></div><div class="home-about_text-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">Accredited &amp; trusted</h3><div class="text-size-regular">An IATA-accredited agent, NANTA member and NCAA-recognised, on the Amadeus network — accountable to industry standards.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
  <header data-theme="dark" class="section_build-cta"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large"><div class="build-cta_component"><div class="build-cta_header-wrap"><div data-wf--header-block--size="medium---centre" class="header-wrapper w-variant-ad828f27-e9ee-986a-b474-73e7a657278c"><div class="header-text-wrap"><div class="header-top"><h2 class="heading-style w-variant-ad828f27-e9ee-986a-b474-73e7a657278c">Travel enriches the mind, body and soul</h2></div><p class="body-text">That belief is why Skyrule exists — and why we sweat every detail of every trip, from fare rules to visa timelines to the pick-up waiting at arrivals. You focus on the going; we handle everything else.</p></div><div class="button-group"><Button href="/contact" label="Get in touch" icon={false} /></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header>
</BaseLayout>
